
FOR dev testing of app:
1. you should still be in the top-level flask-tutorial directory, not the flaskr package.
2. $ flask --app flaskr run --debug



{% block title %} will change the title displayed in the browser’s tab and window title. (displays the website name, usually stays the same for pages shared on same website (displays flaskr))

{% block header %} is similar to title but will change the title displayed on the page. (unqiue to that specific page)

{% block content %} is where the content of each page goes, such as the login form or a blog post.